factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script says the Collector inspected a school construction in Elachipalayam as the opening sentence, which is a framing not stated in the article; the article says the inspections covered several projects across Tiruchengode and Elachipalayam, with the school being one of them.
  The caption says the Collector inspected the school construction work in Elachipalayam as its headline, but the article places the school in Elachipalayam panchayat union, Iluppuli; the headline framing of 'ரூ.98.96 லட்சம் பள்ளி' as the main story is an emphasis not supported by the article's structure.
  The reel_script says 'அவர்களின் எதிர்கால இலக்குகள் குறித்து ஆலோசனைகளும் வழங்கினார்' — the article says the Collector encouraged students and gave advice on future goals, but the reel_script omits the encouragement (ஊக்குவித்ததோடு) detail, which is a minor omission of an article fact.
  The slides_spec line 'கட்டுமானத்துக்கு ரூ.98.96 லட்சம் செலவு' and the 'எலச்சிபாளையத்தில் ரூ.98.96 லட்சம் பள்ளி' headline are consistent, but the slide 'ஆட்சியர் எல்.மதுபாலன் புதன்கிழமை ஆய்வு செய்தார்' is fine; no issue there.
  The slides_spec line 'திருச்செங்கோடு நகராட்சி திரையரங்குகளின் உரிமம் புதுப்பித்தல்' is ungrammatical/unclear in Tamil as a bullet: it reads as a noun phrase with no verb, leaving the nature of the work (a licence renewal review) unclear.
  The caption says 'நகராட்சித் திரையரங்குகளின் உரிமம் புதுப்பித்தல்' is one of the items 'ஆய்வு செய்தார்', mixing a licence-renewal matter into the inspection list without the article's distinction that it was a field inspection related to licence renewal of cinemas.
